          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand when you can use Mako Partial Knee in your practice</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Identify key indications for partial knee procedures</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Evaluate joint balancing and understand how to balance</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Review complex procedures, including lateral, bicompartmental and patellofemoral partial knees</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 11 2025 20:39:17 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
